      "name": "about_content",
      "value": "WlAN Analyzer v2.0\nAurora Build 2026\n\nDeveloper: xinxin\n\nNetwork Diagnostics Toolbox\nComprehensive WiFi analysis & network diagnostic tool"
    },
    {
      "name": "privacy_content",
      "value": "Privacy Policy\n\nUpdated: May 2026\n\nWlAN Analyzer respects and protects user privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.\n\n1. Information Collection\nThis app only collects the following information with your explicit consent:\n• Location: Used for scanning nearby WiFi networks (required by HarmonyOS)\n• WiFi Info: Used for displaying network status, signal strength, channel analysis\n\n2. Information Usage\nCollected data is used solely for in-app feature display and is not uploaded to any server.\n\n3. Data Storage\nAll data is stored locally on your device and is not transmitted externally.\n\n4. Third-Party Services\nThis app does not integrate any third-party analytics or advertising SDKs.\n\n5. Contact Us\nFor privacy-related issues, please contact: 1218478630@qq.com"
    },
    {
      "name": "agreement_content",
      "value": "User Agreement\n\nUpdated: May 2026\n\nWelcome to WlAN Analyzer. By using this app, you agree to the following terms.\n\n1. Service Description\nThis app provides WiFi scanning, network diagnostics, signal analysis, and other features. Features are for personal learning and research purposes only.\n\n2. Usage Rules\n• Do not use this app for any illegal purposes\n• Do not crack, decompile, or modify this app\n• Do not use this app for network attacks or infringement of others' rights\n\n3. Disclaimer\nThis app is provided \"as is\" without warranty of uninterrupted or error-free operation. To the extent permitted by law, the developer shall not be liable for any indirect damages.\n\n4. Intellectual Property\nThe intellectual property rights of this app and all its content belong to the developer.\n\n5. Agreement Changes\nWe may modify this agreement from time to time. The modified agreement takes effect upon publication."
    },
    {
      "name": "feedback_content",
      "value": "Feedback\n\nThank you for using WlAN Analyzer!\n\nContact\n• Email: 1218478630@qq.com\n• Website: www.xinnxin.cn\n\nFeature Suggestions\nIf you have ideas for new features or improvements, feel free to contact us through the channels above. We value every user's feedback.\n\nBug Reports\nIf you encounter a bug or issue, please provide:\n• Device model and system version\n• Steps to reproduce the issue\n• Screenshots of the error (if available)"
